      "subject": "Malki-Tsedek",
      "rationale": "Tɔgɔ in kɔrɔ ye 'n ka masakɛ ye tiɲɛ-ɲuman ye' — tɔgɔ ka kɔrɔ-fɔli min bɛ Bamanankan na, o tɛ yen."
